+### ============================================================
+### DEPARTMENT API
+### ============================================================
+### Local facility id for development (see application-local.properties):
+### @facilityId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
+
+### POST Create Department - Login + CSRF Required
+### facilityId must belong to an existing facility.
+### Expected: 201 Created
+POST http://localhost:8080/api/departments
+Content-Type: application/json
+X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
+
+{
+  "facilityId": "{{facilityId}}",
+  "code": "OPD",
+  "name": "Outpatient Department"
+}
